            <ArticleTitle>Sclerosing peritonitis due to practolol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1393-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Six patients developed intestinal obstruction from sclerosing peritonitis due to practolol. Complete surgical removal of the abnormal membrane appears to be necessary.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
